WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:05.794
Adding means putting together. Here are two. Then one more comes.

00:06.244 --> 00:10.633
Two and one more. Count them all. One, two, three.

00:11.083 --> 00:15.053
Taking away means some go away. Here are four.

00:15.503 --> 00:20.589
One goes away. Now count what is left. One, two, three.

00:21.039 --> 00:24.800
Adding makes more. Taking away makes less.

00:25.250 --> 00:32.007
Now you try. Put three together with two more. How many are there now? Count them all.
